{"id":"52f8d393a9bbb21e","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-beth.md","title":"$\beth$ Numbers","display":"df-beth — $\beth$ Numbers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-beth","aliases":["58-df-beth"],"display":"df-beth — $\beth$ Numbers","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-beth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-beth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beth — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\beth\">\\(\beth\\)</span> Numbers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-beth-—-$\\beth$-Numbers\">df-beth — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth\">\\(\\beth\\)</span> Numbers</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\alpha,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\alpha,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth_\\alpha(\\kappa)\">\\(\\beth_\\alpha(\\kappa)\\)</span> (generalized beth-hierarchy value defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beth} \\vdash \\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\bigl(\\beth_0(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\beth_{\\alpha+1}(\\kappa)=2^{\\beth_\\alpha(\\kappa)})\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\beth_\\lambda(\\kappa)=\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\lambda}\\beth_\\alpha(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beth} \\vdash \\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\bigl(\\beth_0(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\beth_{\\alpha+1}(\\kappa)=2^{\\beth_\\alpha(\\kappa)})\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\beth_\\lambda(\\kappa)=\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\lambda}\\beth_\\alpha(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beth\\text{-}standard} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\beth_\\alpha=\\beth_\\alpha(\\omega))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beth\\text{-}standard} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\beth_\\alpha=\\beth_\\alpha(\\omega))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The standard hierarchy is obtained from the generalized hierarchy by starting at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth_\\alpha=\\beth_\\alpha(\\omega)\">\\(\\beth_\\alpha=\\beth_\\alpha(\\omega)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth_\\omega\">\\(\\beth_\\omega\\)</span> is the limit of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth\">\\(\\beth\\)</span> hierarchy.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth_\\alpha\">\\(\\beth_\\alpha\\)</span> grows at least as fast as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_\\alpha\">\\(\\aleph_\\alpha\\)</span> under GCH.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-beth-—-$\\beth$-Numbers","text":"df-beth — $\\beth$ Numbers","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","